    "description": "What: AQ102 S4 (CE-2355) - on cqb-village, 'Red Squad' (Hostile, 'Red 1-3', default squad SOP) defends the OBJ house (house-3f, footprint x 125-135 / y 161-169) with SquadDefend. 'Shooter' (Friend grenadier, immortal) stands in the open at (130,130) and fires at the windows (CombatPosture, stay); 'Hugger' (Friend grenadier, immortal, crouched, InertSop) is against the south wall at (130,159.2) - every defender saw him get there (he is in their memory). Judge (90 s): (1) a defender shot at ducks within 2 s; (2) ONE defender moves to an opening that sees the Hugger; (3) a grenade is dropped at the Hugger; (4) no defender's look follows the Hugger while he is out of that defender's sight. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch rf-wall-hugger. \ud83d\udcc4 docs/blueprints/Architect_Question_102_Responsive_Fighting_Reflexes.md \u00a75"
